+| D-21 | Several servers per person: each server is one destination, independent, knowing nothing of the others, publishing a stable `serverId`; the client binds a project to one server at most and chooses roots and areas per server. | The author runs one server per client. | Part 6 keys its ledger by `serverId` and migrates part 4's `destination`. |
